        <item>
            <title>0.85</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 04:51:08 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1791348164</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.85</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>The code editor is now a full IDE-style editor. It adds code folding, a minimap, multiple cursors, snippets, inline Git blame and a Find in Files panel.</li>
<li>The editor also gains a quick picker with fuzzy matching, code completion and language-server editing features, back/forward navigation history, and handling of file encodings and line endings.</li>
<li>Addy now requires an Addy account in release builds. You sign in during onboarding through a new account step.</li>
<li>Connected Agents settings has new Connect buttons for Claude and ChatGPT that set up the connection for you.</li>
<li>Addy Mobile shows addy://conversation/… links in chat as conversation cards. Tapping a card opens that conversation, as clicking it on the Mac does.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Connected connector cards use a two-row layout. The Connections pane now shows CLI logos and normal-size buttons.</li>
<li>Adding a connector now replaces a hand-added MCP server of the same name instead of conflicting with it.</li>
<li>The theme preview cards now draw empty panes.</li>
<li>Grok&#x27;s multi-line args arrays in MCP config are now read correctly.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Connector sign-ins keep working after the Keychain move, so you no longer have to reconnect.</li>
<li>Fixed the wide gap after bullets on nested list items in chat messages.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Internal Changes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Removed DeepWiki, Cloudflare Docs and Exa from the connector catalog.</li>
<li>The Settings sidebar is now built from a single list of pages.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
